&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Senior Marketing Manager – Mirakl Ads, EMEA&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;📍 London&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;my-4 border-b border-primary-150&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;1. The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our EMEA Marketing team led by Hélène Kehren, VP of Marketing EMEA. You will also work closely with our EMEA VP of Sales for Mirakl Ads and his GTM teams. Together, you&#39;ll be driving awareness and pipeline growth for Mirakl Ads across the region.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;my-4 border-b border-primary-150&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;2. Your Impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
