&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate Business Cadence: &lt;/strong&gt;Maintain the global sales operational rhythm, including leadership reviews, quarterly business reviews, strategic offsites, and key team communication forums, ensuring priorities are proactively tracked and fire drills are minimized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Alignment with Sales Strategy &amp;amp; Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner seamlessly with Sales Strategy &amp;amp; Operations by translating strategic outputs into operational workstreams, leadership narratives, and review frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communications &amp;amp; Collateral:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive end-to-end preparation of strategic collateral, executive presentations, board materials, and organizational communications in close coordination with Internal Comms partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Track Strategic Priorities &amp;amp; Follow-Through&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Track &amp;amp; Report on Key Commercial Initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Track high-priority commercial initiatives and global sales bets, ensuring every key initiative has a clearly defined owner, success metrics, and milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accountability &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure regional and functional leaders leave executive reviews with clear action items and deadlines; track ongoing performance against overarching organization priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Initiative Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive alignment and operational support for complex, multi-functional sales initiatives across GTM, Product, Marketing, and SS&amp;amp;O.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of relevant experience in a Sales/revenue/business strategy &amp;amp; operations role within an ad sales organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the rhythm of the business in a high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional problem-solving skills, with a proven ability to synthesize complex data/insights and build actionable strategies around the highest impact opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication and relationship building skills, with the ability to build trust and influence across all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented and committed to driving measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovative operator, accustomed to leveraging technology (i.e. AI, tooling), to scale, improve and help the team operate more effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Ideal Candidate:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Believes in Reddit’s mission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is organized and can build their own structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is a strong communicator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is an optimist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is humble&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can effectively communicate with everyone from engineers to sales&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is fact-based, and willing to be hypothesis-driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Needs limited guidance and no instruction manual&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acts as a force multiplier vs. a barrier to their executive partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Benefit programs that fit your lifestyle, from workspace to professional development to caregiving support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family Planning Support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-Affirming Care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Health &amp;amp; Coaching Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group Personal Pension Scheme with Employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical and Dental Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income Replacement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bike to Work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Vacation &amp;amp; Paid Volunteer Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;In select roles and locations, the interviews will be recorded, transcribed and summarized by artificial intelligence (AI). You will have the opportunity to opt out of recording, transcription and summarization prior to any scheduled interviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;During the interview, we will collect the following categories of personal information: Identifiers, Professional and Employment-Related Information, Sensory Information (audio/video recording), and any other categories of personal information you choose to share with us. We will use this information to evaluate your application for employment or an independent contractor role, as applicable.&amp;nbsp; We will not sell your personal information or disclose it to any third party for their marketing purposes.&amp;nbsp; We will delete any recording of your interview promptly after making a hiring decision.&amp;nbsp; For more information about how we will handle your personal information, including our retention of it, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://redditinc.com/policies/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy for Potential Employees and Contractors&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reddit is proud to be an equal opportunity employer, and is committed to building a workforce representative of the diverse communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; Reddit is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures. If, due to a disability, you need an accommodation during the interview process, please let your recruiter know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;About Team &amp;amp; About Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik&#39;s Alliances team works with the world&#39;s leading systems integrators to help hospitals, banks, governments and other critical organisations across EMEA keep operating through cyberattacks. As Director, GSI Alliances EMEA, you&#39;ll build and lead the regional GSI strategy from the ground up, turning partnerships with the biggest integrators into a repeatable engine for pipeline, services and cyber resilience outcomes. This is a rare chance to shape how Rubrik goes to market through GSIs across a whole region, with real ownership of the strategy and the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and own Rubrik&#39;s EMEA GSI strategy, deciding which partners to prioritise and where to invest, so Rubrik is the data security platform integrators lead with in customer resilience programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive-level relationships with the regional and global leadership of our priority GSIs, creating joint plans that turn partnership into sourced and influenced pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales, Pre-Sales, Marketing and Specialist sales teams to align GSI engagement to key accounts, so customers get a joined-up Rubrik and partner experience from first conversation to deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale GSI service offerings, certifications and practices around Rubrik&#39;s platform, including data security, cyber recovery and identity resilience, so more customers can adopt faster with trusted delivery partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, coach and develop a high-performing GSI alliances team, creating clear paths for people to grow as the region scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the GSI forecast, business plans and quarterly reviews, using data to show what&#39;s working and where to double down&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Rubrik at partner events, customer briefings and industry forums, shaping how the market sees us in regulated sectors such as financial services, public sector and healthcare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with global Alliances and Product leadership to bring EMEA partner and customer insight into roadmap, programme and incentive decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Experience You&#39;ll Need&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial experience in alliances, partnerships or channel leadership within enterprise software, ideally cybersecurity, data protection, cloud or infrastructure, with a strong track record working with GSIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success building GSI relationships at senior level and turning them into measurable pipeline and revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing teams, or leading through influence across Sales, Marketing and Services without direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of how GSIs make money (services attach, managed services, practice build-outs) and how to build joint value propositions around that&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build and execute a regional strategy across multiple countries, cultures and regulatory environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and executive presence, comfortable with CxO-level conversations in both partner and customer settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial discipline: you plan, forecast and report with rigour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a GSI or alliances function in a high-growth or scaling company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with EMEA regulatory drivers such as DORA and NIS2 and how they shape cyber resilience buying&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships with major GSIs and regional integrators across EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional European languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with marketplace and co-sell motions across the major hyperscalers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (NYSE: RBRK) is the Security and AI Operations Company, delivering one platform built at the intersection of data, identity, and AI. The platform enables agentic cyber resilience and trusted AI operations for enterprises worldwide, built to recover before disruption strikes and stay a step ahead, so security is never the reason ambition stalls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
