&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of aviation and tactical communications systems, plus the fundamentals of Ethernet and IP networking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python for test automation and data analysis, and a habit of automating any measurement you take more than twice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work across disciplines: defining product requirements, running trade analyses, developing specifications, and conducting system-level tests with people who are not RF engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
