&lt;h3&gt;About Ogilvy&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Ogilvy UK has been creating iconic ideas that deliver impact at scale for clients ever since David Ogilvy founded the company in 1948. Ogilvy UK specialises in bringing together brand advertising, customer experience marketing, PR, influence and consulting, all fuelled by Behavioural Science. Our world-class award-winning creative campaigns deliver solutions for clients including Sainsbury’s, Argos, , Mondelēz International, Unilever, TK Maxx and Pernod Ricard.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;In 2023, Ogilvy UK celebrated their&amp;nbsp;75th&amp;nbsp;anniversary and was the most awarded agency in Europe. Ogilvy is home to the largest influencer marketing practice globally, and hosts the world’s biggest festival of behavioural science and creativity,&amp;nbsp;Nudgestock&amp;nbsp;– now in its&amp;nbsp;12th&amp;nbsp;year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead larger, multi-faceted projects, ensuring delivery aligns seamlessly with client ambitions and agency standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build enduring partnerships with mid-level clients founded on strategic clarity, mutual trust, and creative excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect strategic thinking with creative development, guiding teams to craft meaningful solutions to client challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support team development through coaching and mentorship, fostering an inclusive environment where individuals can grow and succeed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide thoughtful, steady leadership to anticipate project needs, resolve challenges collaboratively, and deliver high-quality work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted strategic advisor to clients, developing a deep understanding of their business goals, audience, and evolving market landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the bridge between strategy and delivery, facilitating discussions that ensure creative ideas are grounded in robust, audience-focused insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute constructively to creative reviews, offering thoughtful feedback that enriches the work and enhances campaign effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee commercial health and financial management, including scope development, fee tracking, and project profitability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide multidisciplinary teams through the full delivery lifecycle, from initial concept development through to final production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and empower junior colleagues, providing regular feedback, encouragement, and opportunities to take on new responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model inclusive collaboration, clear accountability, and balanced perspective during busy, complex delivery cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead client-facing presentations and communications, representing the agency’s work with clarity, warmth, and strategic intent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate thoughtfully for account and team needs across the agency to ensure appropriate resourcing, wellbeing, and support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Need&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience guiding complex client accounts and multi-channel creative projects within an agency setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic mindset with the ability to connect commercial objectives to inspiring creative opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathetic, supportive leadership skills that encourage collaboration, psychological safety, and shared team success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constructive problem-solving abilities to anticipate risks early and navigate evolving priorities with composure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-honed organisational skills to coordinate multiple stakeholders, complex workflows, and key milestones smoothly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, engaging, and open communication skills for presenting concepts, facilitating discussions, and managing expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of the creative and production process, paired with an enthusiasm for championing bold, impactful work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial awareness with experience overseeing scopes of work, budgets, and overall project finances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability, emotional intelligence, and a dedicated commitment to championing client success and team growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
